- file: src/services/openaiService.ts
  why: pollUntilComplete needs timeout + slower interval + logging
  pattern: Lines 59-86 — the while(true) polling loop with 2-second delay
  gotcha: |
    - Currently polls every 2 SECONDS — API recommends 10-20 seconds
    - No timeout — job stuck in in_progress will hang FOREVER
    - Implement 20-minute absolute timeout (Date.now() + 20*60*1000)
    - Add [Poll] prefixed console logs: status, progress, elapsed time

- file: src/App.tsx
  why: Multi-segment generation loop needs per-segment error recovery and timeout handling
  pattern: Lines 254-313 — the for loop generating segments
  gotcha: |
    - Currently throws segmentError which aborts ALL remaining segments
    - Should mark failed segment, log error, and continue with remaining segments
    - OR: implement retry per segment before giving up
